            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "Undressing the handle",
            "content": [
                "Unclip the top of the handle from the back (clips circled in the photos).",
                "Unclip the top of the handle from the front (clips circled in the photo). Be careful not to break (like us) the steam nozzle!",
                "Pull out the steam control knobs.",
                "Carefully \"tear\" the temperature adjustment knob."
            ],
